<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SOCCER-AFRICAN NATIONS CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AFRICAN NATIONS CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of African Nations</p>
<p>Cup qualifiers on Sunday:</p>
<p>Group Five:</p>
<p>In Yaounde:</p>
<p>Cameroon 1 Kenya 1 (halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Cameroon - Fabrice Moreau 89 pen</p>
<p>Kenya - Francis Were 49</p>
<p>Attendance: 30,000</p>
